          <mxGeometry x="836" y="756" width="420" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flowText" value="1.  User taps &quot;Place order&quot; in the React Checkout page&#10;2.  api/client.js sends POST /api/orders with the JWT in the Authorization header&#10;3.  Vite dev proxy (or nginx in prod) forwards the request to the backend container&#10;4.  FastAPI validates the JWT → resolves the user → validates the request body with Pydantic&#10;5.  Business logic re-reads every menu item price from PostgreSQL and recomputes the total server-side&#10;6.  SQLAlchemy inserts the order + order_items rows inside one transaction&#10;7.  201 Created with the full order JSON travels back → React navigates to /orders/{id} and begins polling" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#78350F;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="836" y="780" width="675" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
